{"4271950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HYPERFRAG", "steam_appid": 4271950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5014700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/1bf08ddfaadaddbc2ec8a2224708e74b.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into relentless, close-quarters multiplayer combat built around pure skill, lightning-fast reflexes, and chaotic variety. <strong>HYPERFRAG</strong> delivers a free-to-play, hyper-dynamic FPS experience where everything is stripped down to the absolute essentials: you, your partner, and the enemy in microscopic arenas designed for maximum tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.poster.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.webm?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.mp4?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget giant maps and tedious running. Here, engagement is immediate. Prove your dominance in intense 1v1 duels or coordinated 2v2 face-offs across a rapid rotation of compact killing grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.poster.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.webm?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.mp4?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Master Every Mode &amp; Weapon :</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Match Types : Clutch it out in Best of 5 (BO5) tactical rounds, unleash absolute chaos in Free-For-All (FFA), or adapt on the fly in escalating Gun Game matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming Arsenal : Fight with a massive collection of firearms. From classic, laser-accurate rifles to utterly unique, experimental weapons with wild behaviors, every tool of destruction feels entirely distinct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Casual Momentum : No skill-based matchmaking, no artificial filler, and no ultra-competitive grind sessions. Just jump in, respawn instantly, and enjoy unpredictable, skill-driven combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERFRAG</strong> is built for players who want immediate fun, instant momentum, and arena combat that never slows down.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/1bf08ddfaadaddbc2ec8a2224708e74b.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into relentless, close-quarters multiplayer combat built around pure skill, lightning-fast reflexes, and chaotic variety. <strong>HYPERFRAG</strong> delivers a free-to-play, hyper-dynamic FPS experience where everything is stripped down to the absolute essentials: you, your partner, and the enemy in microscopic arenas designed for maximum tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.poster.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.webm?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/f9e9c8bd6f8909d06f16615f993788df.mp4?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget giant maps and tedious running. Here, engagement is immediate. Prove your dominance in intense 1v1 duels or coordinated 2v2 face-offs across a rapid rotation of compact killing grounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.poster.avif?t=1786792093\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.webm?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/extras/a934cd5238122ccf86d396053194b187.mp4?t=1786792093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Master Every Mode &amp; Weapon :</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Match Types : Clutch it out in Best of 5 (BO5) tactical rounds, unleash absolute chaos in Free-For-All (FFA), or adapt on the fly in escalating Gun Game matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming Arsenal : Fight with a massive collection of firearms. From classic, laser-accurate rifles to utterly unique, experimental weapons with wild behaviors, every tool of destruction feels entirely distinct.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure Casual Momentum : No skill-based matchmaking, no artificial filler, and no ultra-competitive grind sessions. Just jump in, respawn instantly, and enjoy unpredictable, skill-driven combat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPERFRAG</strong> is built for players who want immediate fun, instant momentum, and arena combat that never slows down.</p>", "short_description": "Instantly dive into ultra-dynamic 1v1 and 2v2 arena combat. Face off in bite-sized, high-speed maps where pure reflexes and a massive, wild arsenal dictate who stays alive. Fast rounds, instant respawns, and non-stop momentum : welcome to HYPERFRAG.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/63ae2a373428d7f3bf27197c6c2c6847a0df61e6/header.jpg?t=1786792093", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/9d43504827f540f4d29ac2a68e2f1e10c1ba83bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786792093", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4271950/9d43504827f540f4d29ac2a68e2f1e10c1ba83bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786792093", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400, AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nv